<BaseLayout
  title="Terms | Bush Gums"
  description="Terms for using the Bush Gums product research website."
  noindex
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <h1>Using Bush Gums.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Bush Gums provides general product research and editorial guidance for
        people planning beginner overnight hikes.
      </p>
      <h2>Research, not retail</h2><p>
        Bush Gums does not sell or fulfil the products shown. We do not provide
        the merchant warranty. Any external purchase is governed by the external
        merchant’s terms, price, availability, shipping, returns and warranty
        conditions.
      </p>
      <h2>Evidence and changing listings</h2><p>
        Specifications may originate from manufacturers, retailers or sellers.
        Evidence provenance is labelled where practical, but figures, listings
        and availability can change. Prices on this site were recorded on the date
        shown and are not a promise of a current price.
      </p>
      <h2>General information</h2><p>
        Recommendations and comparison results are not personalised hiking or
        safety advice. Comparison products are category matched, not identical.
        You remain responsible for route, weather, park, equipment and emergency
        planning, including checking current official advice.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>
        Some links may earn Bush Gums a commission at no extra cost to you. We
        disclose those relationships and keep them separate from evidence-status
        labels.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
